    {
      "@id": "0qcf8efee4",
      "type": "lead",
      "text": "`1.0.0` 文档校验只跑拷入的旧版 Zod，`safeParse` 通过与否对齐旧阅读器。`1.1.0` 结构门仍走 Ajv，语义门为 `i18n110` 与 `atId110`。两版校验都不做 Mermaid parse。删除 `@airp/validate/node`。HTML SSR 单图 `render` 失败时整页仍成功，图位输出错误块，结果带 `severity: warning` 诊断。`1.0.0` 取文案按旧版退回。不改 `.agents`。测试物料只在 `fixtures/airp/`。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "55d7edqc9m",
      "type": "section",
      "title": "旧版参照路径",
      "lead": "落地时打开下列绝对路径；禁止凭记忆改写 Zod 规则。",
      "children": [
        {
          "@id": "kpf3dgakzt",
          "type": "definitionList",
          "items": [
            {
              "@id": "nk431n9zbb",
              "term": "结构校验",
              "definition": "`/Users/maosong/Downloads/airp-1.0.0/renderer/src/lib/airp-schema.ts` — `airpDocumentSchema` / `parseAirpDocument`。未知对象键由 Zod 默认丢弃。拷入后依赖钉 `zod@4.4.3`。"
            },
            {
              "@id": "xl1lc2x991",
              "term": "取文案",
              "definition": "`/Users/maosong/Downloads/airp-1.0.0/renderer/src/lib/i18n.ts` 的 `resolveLocalized`：当前 locale → `defaultLocale` → `locales` 里第一句有值 → 对象第一句。"
            },
            {
              "@id": "ixhz88b74a",
              "term": "Mermaid 失败呈现",
              "definition": "`/Users/maosong/Downloads/airp-1.0.0/renderer/src/components/mermaid-diagram.tsx`：`catch` 后图内显示错误，文档其余继续。SSR 用 callout `danger` 风格错误块对齐「整页仍输出」；不要求像素级复刻旧浏览器壳。"
            },
            {
              "@id": "r15yhlivjg",
              "term": "协议 JSON 结构表",
              "definition": "`packages/protocol` 的 `1.0.0` document schema 与 `getSchemaSet(\"1.0.0\")` 保留供 protocol 自测。产品校验 `1.0.0` **不**调用它们。未知键（如 `callout.tone`、`openQuestion.impact`）不登记为正式字段。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "286e6l3tip",
      "type": "section",
      "title": "目标形态",
      "children": [
        {
          "@id": "oxs9n7b4r0",
          "type": "group",
          "title": "校验",
          "children": [
            {
              "@id": "gni3d28g8w",
              "type": "code",
              "language": "typescript",
              "filename": "packages/validate/src/registry.ts（目标）",
              "code": "const VALIDATION_PIPELINES = {\n  \"1.0.0\": {\n    gates: [document100],\n    semantics: [],\n  },\n  \"1.1.0\": {\n    gates: [document110, i18n110, atId110],\n    semantics: [],\n  },\n} satisfies VersionRegistry<ValidationPipeline>;"
            },
            {
              "@id": "xs2emycb3a",
              "type": "definitionList",
              "items": [
                {
                  "@id": "5j6gg5bavt",
                  "term": "document100",
                  "definition": "`validators/document/v1-0-0.ts`：只调用拷入的 `airpDocumentSchema.safeParse`。失败时一条诊断（码表新增或收敛后的 document 码，`severity: error`），`message` 为该次 `ZodError.message`；通过则诊断为空。不调用 `getSchemaSet`。"
                },
                {
                  "@id": "kzscdkuego",
                  "term": "document110",
                  "definition": "`validators/document/v1-1-0.ts`：`getSchemaSet(schemaVersion).validate` + `validationStageResult(\"document\", …)`。仅 `1.1.0` registry 引用。"
                },
                {
                  "@id": "lpcvrsxblu",
                  "term": "删除",
                  "definition": "删除 `validators/i18n/v1-0-0.ts`、`validators/block-id/v1-0-0.ts`、`validators/mermaid-parse/**`、`validators/shared/collect-mermaid-sources/**`、整棵 `src/node/`（`index` / `registry` / `ensure-mermaid-dom`）。`package.json` 去掉 `./node` 导出与 `mermaid` / `jsdom` 依赖。无消费者的 i18n100 / block-id / mermaid-parse 码表条目一并删。`apps/validate-cli`、`apps/renderer-cli`、`apps/renderer-vscode` 改 import `@airp/validate`。"
                },
                {
                  "@id": "33p3pm7gaf",
                  "term": "PipelineCase",
                  "definition": "`@airp/test-kit` 的 `PipelineCase` 去掉 `mode`（仅同构入口）。`run-pipeline-case` 只调 `validateDocument`。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "@id": "y95yjmcn19",
              "type": "decision",
              "title": "按 registry 换门，不在 document100 内分叉",
              "status": "accepted",
              "chosen": "document100 = Zod；document110 = Ajv；两行各引各的",
              "rationale": "版本路由要求按版文件 + registry 穷尽映射。"
            },
            {
              "@id": "15umj88hnx",
              "type": "decision",
              "title": "校验不做 Mermaid parse；删除 validate Node 入口",
              "status": "accepted",
              "chosen": "两版 gates 均无 parse；调用方只用 `@airp/validate`",
              "rationale": "坏图只在 HTML 导出用 warning + 页内错误块表达。Node 入口存在的唯一理由是 parse，删除。"
            },
            {
              "@id": "tdbtqa5ru5",
              "type": "constraint",
              "rule": "`1.0.0` 校验与阅读相关实现锁死：非用户明示，禁止再改 Zod 拷贝、`document100`、以及专为 `1.0.0` 阅读退回写的版本文件。",
              "nonNegotiable": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "@id": "un2j2lz3xm",
          "type": "group",
          "title": "渲染",
          "children": [
            {
              "@id": "3tbijogmiz",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "`renderHtml` 对每张图分别处理：`api.render` 成功则输出 `svg-viewer`；失败则**不**抛 `AirpDiagnosticError`（抛出会被管线收成无产物的 Result）。写入 callout `danger` 风格错误块（转义失败原文；亮/暗色走现有主题），并把 `severity: warning` 的诊断放进 `TargetRenderOutput.diagnostics`（复用或改写 `renderer.targets.html.mermaid.render-failed` 码表 severity 为 `warning`）。`1.0.0` 与 `1.1.0` 共用。Markdown 仍输出源码围栏。"
            },
            {
              "@id": "3hexz32f35",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "`renderer-shared` 按 `schemaVersion` 分派 `resolveLocalized`：`v1-0-0` 实现旧版退回（能读 `defaultLocale` 与 `locales`）；`v1-1-0` 缺键硬失败。`createLocaleFormatContext` 按文档版本绑定 `t` / `tr`。HTML / Markdown emit 不改调用点。重复块 id 仅靠现有 `allocateSectionId` 去重。"
            },
            {
              "@id": "xkfuj9idba",
              "type": "decision",
              "title": "图失败走 warning 诊断且整页有产物",
              "status": "accepted",
              "chosen": "TargetRenderOutput 带 HTML + warning diagnostics；ok 可为 true",
              "rationale": "失败通道：仅 warning ⇒ Result `ok: true`，CLI 打 WARN、退出码可为 0。"
            },
            {
              "@id": "ybvqjcayx9",
              "type": "decision",
              "title": "未知键不提示作者",
              "status": "accepted",
              "chosen": "静默忽略；不映射 tone→variant；不加警告门",
              "rationale": "不增加复杂度；不把未知键登记成正式字段。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
